01:04:20.231 --> 01:04:21.858
NATURAL BEBE
INTERVIEW NG NANAY TF TEAM RECRUITMENT

860
01:04:30.283 --> 01:04:31.742
Aplikante 51, Ms. Go Da-rim.

861
01:04:32.743 --> 01:04:34.203
